My PC: RTX 2080super, R7 3700x, 32GB RAM, NVME SSD;
Recommended System Reqs for this game: GTX 1070, R5 3600x, 16GB RAM;

My PC simply cannot handle the game, the performance is awful, even worse than on PS5 while PS5 GPU is an equivalent of RTX 2070. So, there simply no optimization for PC players. Issued a refund after 1.5 hours of playing since the game is technically unplayable for me: 0/10

Performance is the biggest issue, but I must say I use a Vega 11 integrated GPU so It was predictable.

Great map;
Enemy & World design are impeccable as always;
Classic, but enjoyable, combat;
OST is great;
Good NPC quest lines;
(For someone with a good PC) Awesome graphics.

Honestly, if they fix the performance issue, the game will be, certainly, a GOTY.
